<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back stock at NZ$7.10-25.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back stock at NZ$7.10-25.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of NZ said on Friday it had bought back 714,000 shares on-market at NZ$7.10-7.25 each, bringing the total number of issued shares to 1,803,344,364.</p>
<p>The total excludes 37,894,876 held as treasury stock.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
